WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.852
Imagine you worked really hard all month, but when it was time to get your allowance, the piggy bank broke!

00:00:06.802 --> 00:00:10.144
That's what happened with the Phoenix Pay System.

00:00:10.144 --> 00:00:16.644
The government bought a giant robot computer to pay all of its workers, but the robot was broken.

00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:23.776
It didn't give out the right amounts, and figuring out how to fix it has cost billions and billions of coins!
